{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GUID function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":939,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309756","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GUID-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GUID-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GUID-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GUID function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts a universally unique identifier (UUID)\nvalue into a globally unique identifier (GUID) value. This function\nreturns a GUID as a 36-character string value consisting of 32 hexadecimal\ndigits (0 through 9 and A through F) and 4 hyphens formatted as\nfollows (where X is a hexadecimal digit): <code class=\"ph codeph\">XXXXXXXX—XXXX—XXXX—XXXX—XXXXXXXXXXXX.</code></p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-function__syntax_GC18P02694123\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d462308e98\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GUID-function__idGDL2J02671331\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GUID( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">UUID</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">UUID</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An optional 16-byte raw UUID value to be converted. If the specified\nUUID is not exactly 16 bytes in length, the AVM returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf not specified, the AVM generates a UUID and then converts it\ninto a GUID.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-function__example_GC18P12694133\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d462308e149\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing code fragment illustrates how to use the GUID function:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GUID-function__idGDL2J12671339\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE MyUUID AS RAW       NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE vGUID  AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\n\nASSIGN\n  MyUUID = GENERATE-UUID\n  vGUID  = GUID(MyUUID).</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-function__see-also_GC18P22694137\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d462308e178\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GENERATE-UUID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-UUID-function.html\">GENERATE-UUID function</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GT-or-gt-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GT-or-gt-operator.html\">GT or &gt; operator</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HANDLE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HANDLE-function.html\">HANDLE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309756","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":939,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GUID function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GUID-function.html","type":"Manual"}